.TH MLOCKALL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mlockall \- locks current or future process mappings according to mcl_* flags and resource limits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mman.h>
.B int mlockall(int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Locks current or future process mappings according to MCL_* flags and resource limits.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mlockall (2)
